{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10135290","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10135290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1013529001:0":{"text":"Speaking of, why was there a Mauler here?","source_cn":"说起来，为什么在这里出现了一个蛮血男性？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF9250F48C0ADC90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013529002:0":{"text":"I've seen a few in Oakenfell, but I never expected to find an odd one like Shakir here.","source_cn":"在奎城我倒是见过一些，没想到这里也有，还是个奇怪的蛮血……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6694A089042EC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013529003:0":{"text":"Could he be connected to the sacred items of the Sun Temple?","source_cn":"确实，他的存在会和日神殿的圣物有关吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85E459555A743AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013529004:0":{"text":"Though suspicious, I can't imagine that guy being part of a conspiracy...","source_cn":"虽然很可疑，但总觉得以那个家伙的脑袋而言，很难成为阴谋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7FFE56EF1C90151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"Lucius","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"Temesia","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speak